OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, dry and clear start
OL,6,Facross the region. Cloud builds at
OL,7,Ftimes through the day but remaining
OL,8,Fdry with light winds for all.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining partly cloudy and
OL,12,Fdry into the evening. Turning cold
OL,13,Fagain under clear spells and light
OL,14,Fwinds with a grass frost possible.
OL,15,FCloud builds and winds freshen later
OL,16,Fon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
