OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FWidely cloudy to start the
OL,6,Fday, with a band of light rain
OL,7,Fcrossing during the morning. Further
OL,8,Fpatchy rain follows. Temperatures just
OL,9,Fabove average. Fresh winds at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,12,Fduring Tuesday morning clears to a
OL,13,Ffine, if a little breezy afternoon.
OL,14,FCloudy with some light rain possible
OL,15,Fon Wednesday. Further rain likely on
OL,16,FThursday. Fresh to strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
